      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D03 - Three shapes, one schema\n1. `/products` (json-server, `_page/_limit`) via **P02** backoff\n2. `/catalog?page=N` (HTML cards, `data-pages`) - one page per turn, each page asks the **P04** gate (`d03-catalog`, 5 per 10 s) and waits `retry_after_ms` when throttled\n3. Postgres `products` (numeric/timestamptz types)\n\nEach source -> `{sku, name, category, price_usd, stock, source, seen_at, updated_at}`; Merge -> sort by `updated_at` desc -> Remove Duplicates on `sku` (freshest wins, Postgres wins ties, HTML rows have no date and only win when nobody else has the SKU) -> CSV in `data/out/` + MinIO `artifacts/datasets/` + `documents` row (meta = counts).",
